# ${{ values.apiName }}

${{ values.description }}

The API is served by [Cloud Endpoints](https://cloud.google.com/endpoints/docs) in the Google Cloud project `${{ values.projectId }}`:

- Endpoints service `${{ values.apiName }}.endpoints.${{ values.projectId }}.cloud.goog`, configured from {% if grpc %}`${{ values.grpcSpec }}` and `api_config.yaml`{% else %}`${{ values.openApiSpec }}`{% endif %}
- ESPv2 gateway `${{ values.apiName }}-gateway` on Cloud Run, in front of the backend at `${{ values.backendUrl }}`
{%- if values.enableMonitoring %}
- Cloud Monitoring dashboard and alert policies
{%- endif %}
{%- if values.enableLogging %}
- Log bucket `${{ values.apiName }}-api-logs`
{%- endif %}

## Layout

| Path | Content |
| --- | --- |
{%- if grpc %}
| `${{ values.grpcSpec }}` | gRPC services and messages |
| `api_config.yaml` | Endpoints configuration of the gRPC services |
{%- else %}
| `${{ values.openApiSpec }}` | OpenAPI 2.0 definition of the API |
| `scripts/validate_openapi.py` | Check of the OpenAPI document |
{%- endif %}
| `infra/` | Terraform configuration; settings are in `infra/terraform.tfvars` |
| `.github/workflows/` | `ci.yml` checks every push, `deploy.yml` plans and applies |
| `docs/` | Documentation, shown in the portal as TechDocs |

## Pipelines

- **CI** runs without credentials: Terraform formatting, validation, a plan against a mocked provider (`terraform test`) and lint, a Trivy scan, {% if grpc %}compilation of the proto{% else %}validation of the OpenAPI document{% endif %} and a build of the documentation.
- **Deploy** plans and applies the Terraform configuration once the repository variables `GCP_WORKLOAD_IDENTITY_PROVIDER`, `GCP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT` and `TF_STATE_BUCKET` exist. Until then its plan and apply jobs are skipped.

## Before the first deployment

1. Create the state bucket and the deployment identity and add the three repository variables: [docs/deployment.md](docs/deployment.md#one-time-setup).
{%- if authType == 'jwt' %}
2. Set `jwt_issuer`, `jwt_jwks_uri` and `jwt_audiences` in `infra/terraform.tfvars`: [docs/configuration.md](docs/configuration.md#authentication).
{%- endif %}
{%- if authType == 'oauth2' %}
2. Set `oauth_client_ids` in `infra/terraform.tfvars`: [docs/configuration.md](docs/configuration.md#authentication).
{%- endif %}

